1. What is the business problem?
  A gaming company is trying to create a marketing campaign for their new game coming out. This means that the company needs to figure 
  out who they should advertise to in order to maximize profit. This could also mean deciding how they should advertise to these specific
  people in order to make sure the game launch is as succesful as possible. If the game company does not identify and catch the attention
  of these people the launch of their game will not be succesful.
